# Bab 6 — REST: request examples menunjukkan verb, route, body, bearer credential, dan expected workflow.
# Bab 11 — replace token variables with JWT hasil login sebelum memanggil endpoint protected.
# Bab 16 — file ini adalah executable companion untuk OpenAPI/Swagger-documented contract.
@AspNetCoreDomainLab_HostAddress = http://localhost:5056
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here
@refreshToken = paste-refresh-token-here

GET {{AspNetCoreDomainLab_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Login with a synthetic healthcare user

POST {{AspNetCoreDomainLab_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "healthcare.demo",
  "password": "HealthDemo!123"
}

### Inspect shared identity claims

GET {{AspNetCoreDomainLab_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Healthcare policy succeeds for healthcare.demo

GET {{AspNetCoreDomainLab_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/probes/healthcare
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Banking transfer policy rejects healthcare.demo

GET {{AspNetCoreDomainLab_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/probes/banking-transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Rotate a refresh token

POST {{AspNetCoreDomainLab_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Revoke a refresh token for the current user

POST {{AspNetCoreDomainLab_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Healthcare: create a synthetic patient

POST {{AspNetCoreDomainLab_HostAddress}}/api/v1/healthcare/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "medicalRecordNumber": "MRN-HTTP-001",
  "displayName": "Synthetic Patient HTTP",
  "birthDate": "1988-05-10"
}

### Industrial: create a synthetic asset

POST {{AspNetCoreDomainLab_HostAddress}}/api/v1/industrial/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetCode": "ASSET-HTTP-001",
  "displayName": "Synthetic Press HTTP"
}

### Logistics: retrieve a shipment

GET {{AspNetCoreDomainLab_HostAddress}}/api/v1/logistics/shipments/SYN-DEMO-001
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Banking: inspect synthetic transactions

GET {{AspNetCoreDomainLab_HostAddress}}/api/v1/banking/accounts/{{accountId}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
